        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Prawn masala serves 4 and takes about 35 minutes. Cook the gravy first, then add the prawns at the end so they stay juicy. Watch them closely, as they cook in minutes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Take the prawns off the heat the moment they turn pink and curl."
