      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Prawn masala is quick coastal cooking. It comes together in the time it takes to boil rice. The prawns stay sweet and tender. Serve it over plain rice with lemon. It is a fast way to put fish on the table."
          }
        ]
      }
